 580:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** /************************************************************************
 581:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** This function returns number of processors configured in the system
 582:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** using GetSystemInfo() or sysconf(_SC_NPROCESSORS_ONLN). The value returned
 583:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** is cached, so that subsequent calls do not have syscall overhead.
