1081:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** This function cleans up automatically managed memory before caller terminates
1082:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** ALGLIB executing by ae_break() or by simply stopping calling callback.
1083:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** 
1084:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** For state!=NULL it calls thread_exception_handler() and the ae_state_clear().
