1820:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** This function clears dynamic block (releases  all  dynamically  allocated
1821:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** memory). Dynamic block may be in automatic management list - in this case
1822:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** it will NOT be removed from list.
1823:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** 
1824:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** block               destination block (initialized)
1825:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** 
1826:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** NOTES:
