2041:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** dst                 destination vector
2042:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** src                 well, it is source
2043:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** state               pointer to current state structure. Can not be NULL.
2044:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****                     used for exception handling (say, allocation error results
2045:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****                     in longjmp call).
2046:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** make_automatic      if true, vector will be registered in the current frame
2047:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****                     of the state structure;
2048:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** 
2049:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** dst is assumed to be uninitialized, its fields are ignored.
2050:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** ************************************************************************/
