2412:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** This function initializes ae_matrix using X-structure as source.
2413:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** 
2414:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** New matrix is attached to source:
2415:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** * DST shares memory with SRC
2416:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** * both DST and SRC are writable - all writes to DST  change  elements  of
2417:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****   SRC and vice versa.
2418:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** * DST can be reallocated with ae_matrix_set_length(), in  this  case  SRC
2419:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****   remains untouched
2420:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** * SRC, however, CAN NOT BE REALLOCATED AS LONG AS DST EXISTS
2421:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** 
2422:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** dst                 destination matrix, must be zero-filled
2423:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** src                 well, it is source
