2526:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** /************************************************************************
2527:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** This  function  provides  "CLEAR"  functionality  for vector (contents is
2528:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** cleared, but structure still left in valid state).
2529:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** 
2530:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** The  function clears matrix contents (releases all dynamically  allocated
2531:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** memory). Matrix may be in automatic management list  -  in this  case  it
2532:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** will NOT be removed from list.
2533:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** 
2534:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** IMPORTANT: this function does NOT invalidates dst; it just  releases  all
2535:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** dynamically allocated storage, but dst still may be used  after  call  to
2536:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** ae_matrix_set_length().
2537:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** 
