2603:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** This function creates smart pointer structure.
2604:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** 
2605:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** dst                 destination smart pointer, must be zero-filled
2606:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** subscriber          pointer to pointer which receives updates in the
2607:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****                     internal object stored in ae_smart_ptr. Any update to
2608:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****                     dst->ptr is translated to subscriber. Can be NULL.
2609:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** exclusive           if exclusive, the structure can receive ownership but
2610:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****                     can not transfer ownership; any attempt to request release/transfer
2611:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****                     will result in an exception. The pointer can be free, though.
2612:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** state               pointer to current state structure. Can not be NULL.
2613:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****                     used for exception handling (say, allocation error results
2614:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****                     in longjmp call).
2615:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** make_automatic      if true, pointer will be registered in the current frame
2616:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****                     of the state structure;
2617:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****                       
2618:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** Error handling:
