2685:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** /************************************************************************
2686:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** This function assigns pointer to ae_smart_ptr structure.
2687:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** 
2688:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** dst                 destination smart pointer.
2689:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** new_ptr             new pointer to assign
2690:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** is_owner            whether smart pointer owns new_ptr; if dst is in an exclusive
2691:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****                     mode, is_owner must be true
2692:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** is_dynamic          whether object is dynamic - clearing such object
2693:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****                     requires BOTH calling destructor function AND calling
2694:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****                     ae_free() for memory occupied by object.
2695:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** obj_size            in-memory size of the object. Ignored for is_owner==false.
2696:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** cc                  copy constructor, can not be NULL for new_ptr!=NULL
2697:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** dd                  destructor function; can be NULL for is_owner==ae_false.
2698:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** 
2699:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** In case smart pointer already contains non-NULL value and owns this value,
2700:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** it is freed before assigning new pointer.
2701:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** 
2702:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** Changes in pointer are propagated to its  subscriber  (in  case  non-NULL
