5519:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****     /* 
5520:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****      * General case:
5521:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****      * 1. read and decode six-bit digits
5522:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****      * 2. check that all 11 digits were read
5523:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****      * 3. set last 12th digit to zero (needed for simplicity of conversion)
5524:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****      * 4. convert to 8 bytes
