6303:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** IMPORTANT:
6304:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** * in case target pointer owns non-NULL  value,  it  is deallocated before
6305:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****   storing value retrieved from pool.
6306:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** * recycled object IS NOT removed from pool
6307:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** * target pointer DOES NOT become owner of the new value
6308:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** * this function IS NOT thread-safe
6309:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** * you SHOULD NOT modify shared pool during enumeration (although you  can
6310:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****   modify state of the objects retrieved from pool)
