6311:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** * in case there is no recycled objects left in the pool, NULL is stored.
6312:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** * in case pool is not seeded, NULL is stored.
6313:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** 
6314:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** pool                pool
