12502:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****   stride is alglib_r_block,
12503:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****   aligned on alglib_simd_alignment boundary
12504:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** * X must be aligned on alglib_simd_alignment boundary
12505:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** * Y may be non-aligned
