13136:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** by alpha*A*x without ever being read). However, when  alpha  is  zero,  we 
13137:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** still calculate A*x and  multiply  it  by  alpha  (this distinction can be
