14942:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** /********************************************************************
14943:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** This function reads rectangular matrix A given by two column pointers
14944:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** col0 and col1 and stride src_stride and moves it into contiguous row-
14945:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** by-row storage given by dst.
14946:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** 
14947:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** It can handle following special cases:
14948:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** * col1==NULL    in this case second column of A is filled by zeros
14949:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** ********************************************************************/
14950:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** void _ialglib_pack_n2(
14951:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****     double *col0,
