14996:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** /*************************************************************************
14997:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** This function reads rectangular matrix A given by two column pointers col0 
14998:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** and  col1  and  stride src_stride and moves it into  contiguous row-by-row 
14999:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** storage given by dst.
