15002:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** 
15003:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** It can handle following special cases:
15004:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** * col1==NULL        in this case second column of A is filled by zeros
15005:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** * src_stride==1     efficient SSE-based code is used
15006:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** * col1-col0==1      efficient SSE-based code is used
