15424:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****      *
15425:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****      * VA0 stores current 1x2 block of A, VA1 stores shuffle of VA0,
15426:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****      * VB0 and VB1 are used to store two copies of 1x2 block of B0 or B1
15427:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****      * (both vars store same data - either B0 or B1). Results from multiplication
15428:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****      * by VA0/VA1 are stored in VB0/VB1 too.
