18024:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** /*************************************************************************
18025:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** Matrix-vector product: y := alpha*op(A)*x + beta*y
18026:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** 
18027:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** Here x, y, A are subvectors/submatrices of larger vectors/matrices.
18028:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** 
18029:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** NOTE: this  function  expects  Y  to  be  large enough to store result. No
18030:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****       automatic preallocation happens for  smaller  arrays.  No  integrity
18031:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****       checks is performed for sizes of A, x, y.
18032:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** 
18033:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** INPUT PARAMETERS:
18034:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****     M   -   number of rows of op(A)
18035:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****     N   -   number of columns of op(A)
ARM GAS  C:\Users\subdia\AppData\Local\Temp\ccz6Svo7.s 			page 403


18036:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****     Alpha-  coefficient
18037:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****     A   -   source matrix
18038:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****     IA  -   submatrix offset (row index)
18039:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****     JA  -   submatrix offset (column index)
18040:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****     OpA -   operation type:
18041:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****             * OpA=0     =>  op(A) = A
18042:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****             * OpA=1     =>  op(A) = A^T
18043:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****     X   -   input vector, has at least N+IX elements
18044:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****     IX  -   subvector offset
18045:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****     Beta-   coefficient
18046:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****     Y   -   preallocated output array, has at least M+IY elements
18047:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****     IY  -   subvector offset
18048:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** 
18049:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** OUTPUT PARAMETERS:
18050:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****     Y   -   vector which stores result
18051:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** 
18052:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** HANDLING OF SPECIAL CASES:
18053:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****     * if M=0, then subroutine does nothing. It does not even touch arrays.
18054:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****     * if N=0 or Alpha=0.0, then:
18055:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****       * if Beta=0, then Y is filled by zeros. A and X are  not  referenced
18056:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****         at all. Initial values of Y are ignored (we do not  multiply  Y by
18057:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****         zero, we just rewrite it by zeros)
18058:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****       * if Beta<>0, then Y is replaced by Beta*Y
18059:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****     * if M>0, N>0, Alpha<>0, but  Beta=0,  then  Y  is  replaced  by  A*x;
18060:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****        initial state of Y is ignored (rewritten by  A*x,  without  initial
18061:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****        multiplication by zeros).
18062:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** 
18063:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** 
18064:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****   -- ALGLIB routine --
18065:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** 
18066:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****      01.09.2021
18067:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****      Bochkanov Sergey
18068:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** *************************************************************************/
