18165:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** Rank-1 correction: A := A + alpha*u*v'
18166:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** 
18167:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** NOTE: this  function  expects  A  to  be  large enough to store result. No
18168:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****       automatic preallocation happens for  smaller  arrays.  No  integrity
18169:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp ****       checks is performed for sizes of A, u, v.
18170:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** 
18171:libs/alglib/src/ap.cpp **** INPUT PARAMETERS:
