2637:libs/alglib/src/ap.h ****   ("No conj", for example) to use unmodified parameter. All other
2638:libs/alglib/src/ap.h ****   values will result in conjugation of input, but it is recommended
2639:libs/alglib/src/ap.h ****   to use "Conj" in such cases.
